sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Guard as AGENTGUARD Decision Engine
    participant Queue as Approval Queue (Redis/DB)
    participant Push as WebSocket Push Service
    actor User as Human Owner
    participant UI as Approval Center UI
    participant Payment as Payment Service

    Guard->>Queue: Intent State -> PENDING_APPROVAL (TTL: 15m)
    Queue->>Push: Emit Real-Time Escalation Event
    Push-->>UI: Render Interactive Approval Card (RISK SCORE & XAI Text)
    Push-->>User: Mobile Push / Dashboard Alert
    User->>UI: Inspects XAI Trace & Clicks "APPROVE"
    UI->>Queue: POST /api/v1/approvals/intent_123/action (Action: APPROVE)
    Queue->>Queue: Acquire Atomic Idempotent Action Lock
    Queue->>Payment: Transition State -> AUTHORIZED
    Payment->>Payment: Resume Payment Execution Pipeline
    Payment-->>UI: Execution Confirmed (Payment ID: pay_456)
